class=\"visible-pc\">Vision Fund\\n                  </p>\\n                  <div class=\"blank-icon\">\\n                    <img src=\"https://group.softbank/media/Project/sbg/sbg/assets/img/common/icon_blank.svg\" alt=\"別ウィンドウで表示\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\">\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\"top-rn-business-fund-link-list\">\\n          <ul style=\"justify-content:center\">\\n            <li>\\n              <div class=\"top-rn-business-fund-link-box\">\\n                <a href=\"https://www.latinamericafund.com/\" target=\"_blank\">\\n                  <div class=\"top-rn-business-fund-link-box-inner\">\\n                    <div class=\"top-rn-business-fund-link-box-head\">\\n                      <img src=\"https://group.softbank/media/Project/sbg/sbg/assets/img/top/business_pic_02.jpg\" alt=\"\">\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div class=\"top-rn-business-fund-link-box-body\">\\n                      <p class=\"blank-icon-text\" lang=\"en\">\\n                        SoftBank <br class=\"visible-sp\">Latin America Fund\\n                      </p>\\n                      <div class=\"blank-icon\">\\n                        <img src=\"https://group.softbank/media/Project/sbg/sbg/assets/img/common/icon_blank.svg\" alt=\"別ウィンドウで表示\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\">\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                </a>\\n              </div>\\n            </li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"contents-body\"><div><div class=\"component_TopPageIrNewsList\"><div id=\"block-top-ir-information-title\" data-block-plugin-id=\"block_content:ea9aa364-020b-4ecc-851c-5cf08d979395\" class=\"contents-body\"><div><div class=\"top-title\" data-area-click=\"TOP IR(日)\"><div class=\"headl